<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Frontec, Getronics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Frontec, Getronics.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computing services groups Frontec of Sweden and Getronics of the Netherlands were raised to &quot;trading buy&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
